# TLS 1.3 Benchmark

This directory contains benchmark outputs and experiments for TLS 1.3 handshakes using OpenSSL.

## Cipher Suite

```bash
TLS_AES_128_GCM_SHA256

Benchmark Command

openssl s_time -connect localhost:4433 -new -time 30 -tls1_3 -ciphersuites TLS_AES_128_GCM_SHA256

Measured Metrics
connections per second
total handshakes
computational overhead
estimated RTT-adjusted latency
Notes

TLS 1.3 requires:

TCP handshake → 1 RTT
TLS handshake → 1 RTT

Total: 2RTT
